# Memory Bank

Use the `memory-bank-update` skill for Memory Bank maintenance tasks.

## Scope

- Updating files under `docs/memory/`
- Syncing durable project context after verified changes
- Refreshing Memory Bank docs on explicit request

## Guidance

- Keep activation and scope in this rule.
- Keep the update workflow in `.cursor/skills/memory-bank-update/SKILL.md`.
- Do not treat this rule as a blanket instruction for unrelated edits.

### How to verify

After a durable project-context change, confirm the relevant files under `docs/memory/` were updated, the procedural workflow still lives in `.cursor/skills/memory-bank-update/SKILL.md`, and unrelated edits did not trigger broad memory-bank churn.
